From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 2 Nov 2026 10:50:24 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 100/207] Merge S3 82ce5a278 (lane; ELF only under _ELF=1)

Squashed merge of 3 commits:
- S3: compute lane calls the frontend accepts run on the circuit (in-model runner), the rest in the sandbox (Jay Leaton)
- S3: share the cell runner's circuit and bank; no ELF by default; fold dropped for T3/T2's lowering (Jay Leaton)
- S3: an ELF program runs only under _ELF=1, cached or not (Jay Leaton)
